# Who reviews what. GitHub asks these owners for review on every pull request
# that touches their paths; ZLens Enterprise's "DQL certification" check is the
# steward's approval. Replace the placeholders with your teams.
#
# Stewards certify: every block, Dataset, metric and App.
*                    @your-org/zlens-stewards
domains/             @your-org/zlens-stewards
semantic-layer/      @your-org/zlens-stewards
apps/                @your-org/zlens-stewards
notebooks/           @your-org/zlens-stewards

# Admins own the connection and the workflow: a change to dql.config.json takes
# effect only once merged, and a preview never runs on a changed connection.
dql.config.json      @your-org/zlens-admins
.github/             @your-org/zlens-admins
CODEOWNERS           @your-org/zlens-admins
